{"4553620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Rail", "steam_appid": 4553620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4834950], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based management roguelike. Command the Inquisition and rule an industrial city on the empire’s edge. Use your train to meet prisoner shipment quotas by hunting heretics and slaying magical beasts. Produce supplies, contain revolt, and sacrifice prisoners to stop the madness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNT DOWN HERETICS BY TRAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your inquisitors out by train on deadly quests to hunt down heretics across the frontier. These expeditions cost vital supplies, can raise madness and revolt, and may leave your inquisitors wounded or broken, but they are necessary. The prisoner shipments must never stop, no matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/a5895f3833c9402f52bff2a854a4dec5.poster.avif?t=1785316735\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/a5895f3833c9402f52bff2a854a4dec5.webm?t=1785316735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/a5895f3833c9402f52bff2a854a4dec5.mp4?t=1785316735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR RESOURCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weigh short-term survival against long-term collapse by upgrading taxation for desperately needed income, even as it drives revolt higher. Research barracks improvements to strengthen and level your inquisitors, and pause or time buildings carefully to match your current shortages and priorities. When Revolt rises you may need to gift away supplies to calm the population and when madness rises... sacrifices will have to be made. Every choice affects Revolt, Resources, and Madness. Resource management is the key to lasting another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/5d63f4dfec7838cbd6613e9a7bfa6c65.poster.avif?t=1785316735\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/5d63f4dfec7838cbd6613e9a7bfa6c65.webm?t=1785316735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/5d63f4dfec7838cbd6613e9a7bfa6c65.mp4?t=1785316735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE THE PATHS YOUR INQUISITORS WILL TAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your inquisitors, train them for specialized roles, and assign skills that shape how they survive and perform in the field. Manage their health, level them up in the barracks, and choose carefully who you send on each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/ac2af4f173b3eda5beae8d5f9c9a7068.poster.avif?t=1785316735\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/ac2af4f173b3eda5beae8d5f9c9a7068.webm?t=1785316735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/ac2af4f173b3eda5beae8d5f9c9a7068.mp4?t=1785316735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR PATH WITH THE META UPGRADES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Blood Points by sacrificing prisoners and completing shipment quotas, then spend them in the meta progression path to unlock powerful new abilities, bonuses, and lasting advantages for future runs. Shape your doctrine between playthroughs, expand your options, and return stronger each time to face harsher demands and greater horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/6842c82d60558e640c8a8b995b44a22d.poster.avif?t=1785316735\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/6842c82d60558e640c8a8b995b44a22d.webm?t=1785316735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/6842c82d60558e640c8a8b995b44a22d.mp4?t=1785316735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE POWERS TO DEFEAT MONSTERS EACH RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lets you choose different abilities to shape your strategy and face the dangers ahead. Use them to overcome challenges, survive encounters, and defeat the monsters and magical creatures that stand in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/e5737c4d97bd91bef8707045851285c2.poster.avif?t=1785316735\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/e5737c4d97bd91bef8707045851285c2.webm?t=1785316735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553620/extras/e5737c4d97bd91bef8707045851285c2.mp4?t=1785316735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "ab